expected_result: "The vulnerable Hono versions are excluded; dependency audit is clean, frozen installation is reproducible and MCP consumers and repository verification pass."
actual_result: "Patched graph verification: all 8623 tests in 653 files pass at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage with zero uncovered counts: 63729 statements, 48461 branches, 13216 functions and 61134 lines. All four TypeScript projects and every linked audit, frozen-install and real MCP workflow/HTTP/Apps/transport check pass. pnpm audit reports zero advisories and pnpm why resolves only Hono 4.13.7. Documentation, structural/docstring, graph-composition and record-integrity gates pass. Final pushed-head hosted checks, full platform matrix, preflight and full review govern merge."
